(* A function whose frame is exactly a page, 4096 bytes: its 520 Ints live across calls each take a word. The prologue
   moves sp in one sub of 4096, which arm64 encodes shifted (#1, lsl #12), as the JIT's encoder must too (it once
   wrote the low 12 bits alone, into the register fields). Written by a generator: f's lets are a1 to a520, each
   h(s + k 1), and it returns their sum with z. Its phases' dumps, megabytes, are left out. *)
